#### Preview Instance Migrations

```yaml
- name: Apply database migrations
  env:
    DATABASE_URL: ${{ steps.create-supabase-preview.outputs.database-url }}
  run: |
    # Apply all migrations to the new preview project
    npx prisma db push --accept-data-loss
